  "title": "Prove permitted SLA reads for agents and auditors",
  "body": "DESK-020 point 4 lacked public-route proof for native operators and auditors. Extend slaPolicyChecks with distinct active members reading the same permitted business and calendar tickets, checking bound targets, breach times, exact period rows and counts. The auditor is an explicit beneficiary; unrelated ticket reads, restricted and HR reads, and requester SLA and report reads remain refused.\n\nValidation: work runtime, typecheck, first-party check, contract generation and source integrity check passed. Existing assertions remain in place; no contract cells or generated views changed. All existing role and external holds remain unchanged.",
